-- Modifier cards, wand order A (n2): Damage Plus then Heavy Shot. Twin of 111-modifiers.bqn (order sections). (was n2-modifiers-a)
-- Two stat cards on a flight of bolts. Each card is one statement, and the wand's slot order is the program's statement order — that is the whole compilation.
-- A stat card is a masked value write over the flight group; the bomb bystander is outside the mask and keeps its stats.
-- Wand order is program order: Heavy Shot doubles what Damage Plus already committed — (3+10)*2 = 26. The -b twin swaps the cards and gets 16 from the same two.
--! registry ../registries/111-modifiers.reg
--! expect damage = 0 26 26 26 8
--! expect speed = 0 4 4 4 2

SparkBolt , Damage += 10
SparkBolt , Damage *= 2 ; Speed -= 2
